{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b2b95f96d0257f99176f9c4b91532d3ee0318aafa91db908f5fb252929e3411b", "ja": "（今日は、歩の宣材写真撮影だ。\n快活な歩なら問題ない、と思ったんだけど……）", "zh": "（今天是步拍宣传照的日子。\n本来以为活泼的步不会有问题的，谁知道……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "bb02ad0227ad2fbd6918b2a26ebd19e32c655c9f7ff1c3ba5557eb98bb32c385", "ja": "{$P$}。\nど、どうしよ～……。", "zh": "{$P$}。\n怎、怎么办啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1002_p", "source_sha256": "743df91fecb0f03c58a38d4e8b603a82f92c5638d8a703ed9843d12ab0899b69", "ja": "歩？\n困った顔して、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "步？\n你怎么了？一脸苦恼的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "69136c305e2b92c2fabba47783c3713a141ae2a4c88c110498bce765907acb13", "ja": "いや……アタシ、こういうスタジオで\n写真撮影とかするの、初めてだからさ……。", "zh": "其实……我从来没像这样\n在摄影棚拍过照……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9c6f4b924dba9b430a83de6f975881f1fa1cb74a9cb73c6871074edc6e3e4416", "ja": "写真を撮るんだから、ダンスと違って、\nじっとしてなきゃなんだよね？", "zh": "拍照的时候和跳舞不一样，\n不可以乱动，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3bf7fd231916327c6848116959ea4ccd24636c1bc8e4f4323b86dab23533bff7", "ja": "動かずに自分を表現……って、どうしたらいいんだろ？\n考えてたら、わかんなくなってきちゃってさ～！", "zh": "不能乱动又要展现自己的特色……这该怎么办才好啊？\n我都快想破头啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1006_p", "source_sha256": "cfce82627616859cc65e3bb55f0ffb82064a07ef052a12ded963862ac434d689", "ja": "（そうか……歩は、根っからのダンサーだ。\n動いていた方が、緊張しないのかもしれないな）", "zh": "（原来是这样……步是个天生的舞者。\n让她活动身体，或许就不会那么紧张。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1007_p", "source_sha256": "fc8772032dc406099b29716fcb2ac3d3b5051fe0e86ca32b99913f25ce00fe66", "ja": "ならいっそ、踊っているところを、\n撮影してもらえばいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "那干脆请摄影师\n拍你跳舞的样子不就好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9d0f3c421bcb5f4f3c77460f6820c65c744a8ff7aafc4b6cf145bbe855f5fce1", "ja": "えっ？　でも、ブレたりするんじゃ……。\nいいの？", "zh": "咦？可是，这样照片会糊掉吧……\n没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4a151ffdeaaefeaf6e096745c49f59ea3ea944ff24856be3226e9923dc802767", "ja": "カメラマンさんだってプロなんだ。\nこちらの意図を話せば、きっと対応してくれるよ。", "zh": "摄影师也是专业的。\n先解释我们的用意，相信对方一定能配合的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b33367f5589910ec7a50a27343a3bf2166484a8476298b776a640e12022c2306", "ja": "大事なのは、歩の魅力が出ていることだからな。\nほら、歩。行こう！", "zh": "毕竟最重要的是要展现出步的魅力啊。\n好啦，步，我们走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "cef3d8ba079eccd8bd698c679ead22bbc78941edf3679874b7b26d766f264a64", "ja": "うっ……うん！\n{$P$}、サンキューッ！", "zh": "嗯……嗯！\n{$P$}，谢啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1012_camman", "source_sha256": "4006e13437e117620a4c6c8612d653ddcc293a581ba99dfb1b935fbf07fb2107", "ja": "ダンスしているところを撮影、ですね。\nわかりました、やってみましょう！", "zh": "要拍跳舞时的样子，是吗？\n我明白了，来试试看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1013_camman", "source_sha256": "c931410d96681bad113af67cbac462e749eb7112028630e38263e5c87e9a0f28", "ja": "大丈夫、シャッタースピードは1/1000まで\n変えられるし、連写もできますから。", "zh": "放心，这台的快门速度最高能到1/1000，\n也可以连拍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1014_camman", "source_sha256": "247ef2598ad196cb98c24f476288aa1a5626864c09bfdc816090ae68c7a2fa3a", "ja": "だから歩ちゃんも遠慮しないで、\n思いきって踊っちゃってくださいね！", "zh": "所以小步你用不着客气，\n请你尽情地展现舞技吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4e8dc76c6e5a5966691c8211c00a5cf74851cbf1d5671b7ba4c00b21f82aa3c2", "ja": "あ、ありがとう……！\nアタシ、思いっきり踊るよ！", "zh": "谢、谢谢……！\n我会尽情跳的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1016_p", "source_sha256": "923ae5c1e81472ecb4fe8fcf6ef8d90a08ffae01ae05bae55839d8f718d08ac1", "ja": "ああ、いってこい！", "zh": "很好，快去拍吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1017_p", "source_sha256": "e58e5038799fb16e9ffb303bdabd43518ab91eab18778dad2617c898e0899c81", "ja": "（カメラの前で、歩は宣言どおり、キレのあるダンスを\n踊ってみせた。これなら、きっと……！）", "zh": "（步就如她所说，在镜头前展露俐落的舞步。\n这样看来，一定没问题……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1018_se", "source_sha256": "80c92c8ce42aeadf56fc2e50a7f2de211c564c74baf79d43efa75719e0e097d5", "ja": "パシャパシャパシャパシャパシャ！", "zh": "喀嚓喀嚓喀嚓喀嚓喀嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1020_p", "source_sha256": "cd017489d98974335bb55e1f95d0ffddcc2d638e6df726f72916dfac00ce1624", "ja": "歩、お疲れさま！　すごいダンスだったな。\nお客さんがいないのが、もったいないくらいだ。", "zh": "步，辛苦你了！你跳得很棒。\n真可惜现场没有其他观众能看到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1021_034ayu", "source_sha256": "20f5c4bf5d100baa2fb900f8e5c3edfeab7940c1765a503088ea0f7fa25ff929", "ja": "へへっ、そうだろ？\n思いっきり気合い入れて踊ったよ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，很棒对吧？\n因为是我用尽全心全力跳的舞啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1022_034ayu", "source_sha256": "068b87ebac97bd41a3cf69ee94b133b84bc47abee5046c07ffa8a46b918529cb", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}。\nアイドルの世界って、スゴいんだね！", "zh": "对了，{$P$}。\n偶像的世界真的好棒喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1023_p", "source_sha256": "9460b6d6e2831bbdceac3930be6eea74f5991e1bc2011b77845cc57c063a59b8", "ja": "ん？　どうしたんだ、急に。", "zh": "嗯？你怎么突然这么说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1024_034ayu", "source_sha256": "16324fccc5c958e7e940ac2be69a8fad7422ad290fa11bb6d58a4a4f2b33e01e", "ja": "だってさ、好きなダンスが思いっきり踊れて、\nそれを写真に撮ってもらえるんだよ！？", "zh": "因为我可以尽情地跳自己喜欢的舞蹈，\n然后请人帮我拍成照片啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1025_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3c16770daef87c8d4de23d8b6657adf824e2e3b0d04481104d763f2ae7f9b306", "ja": "やっぱりダンスが、アタシの一番のウリだからさ。\nそれを宣材写真にしてもらえて、すごく嬉しいんだ！", "zh": "我觉得我最大的卖点还是舞蹈。\n所以能把舞姿拍成宣传照，我真的好开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1026_p", "source_sha256": "3b8cb3c6b3e5e1eb197e5e82b874ea9067841c1d8a2a299babd3bf465c4e2f6b", "ja": "うん、そうだな。\nそれじゃさっそく、写真を確かめようか！", "zh": "嗯，对啊。\n那我们赶快来看照片吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1027_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9c1ec5e6eb430f0be966a9886391f3e0dfeb44f0e8a64ac1af17cc806edc419c", "ja": "うんっ！", "zh": "好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1028_camman", "source_sha256": "c8b851c5718d89513916e24d7b096ae0546e6ceab719d8c5ac4d04a95dc5f4a1", "ja": "ええ、すごくよく撮れてますよ！", "zh": "嗯嗯，拍得非常棒喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1029_camman", "source_sha256": "53f6e5efaf57d568f605143b91fbf167c0db493479dd78cff46c7e5828c0dc62", "ja": "ただ、高速連射で1000枚以上撮れてしまったので\n……後で、データで送りますね！", "zh": "只是，我用高速连拍大概拍了1000张以上的照片……\n待会再将档案传过去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1030_034ayu", "source_sha256": "14aaf08a1210b09deb31680382fbb18721d828baa56b77c1e7e16a5b4315f809", "ja": "えっ。\n……せ、1000枚……？", "zh": "咦？\n……1、1000张……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1031_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b38a337ee6b8d25b321c1348c95017cf0bbf8ff6e6a692992d700cdbb045cd1a", "ja": "どれどれ……\nう、うわ！？　全部同じに見える……！！", "zh": "我看看……\n唔、唔哇！？每张看起来几乎都一样……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1032_p", "source_sha256": "86d8408653fa125772f15c6cd904304eb29d2d49c1aea1b0db266fd8e8274e96", "ja": "心配するな、歩。\n俺が最高の1枚を選ぶから！", "zh": "别担心，步。\n我会帮你选出最棒的一张！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1033_034ayu", "source_sha256": "50c196b7d49bd2f78e0a1f3d7549c5cc2e81ba1c434100dc07285c4e916b1378", "ja": "{$P$}……！\nでも、1000枚の中から、どうやって……？", "zh": "{$P$}……！\n不过，要怎么从1000张里面选啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1034_p", "source_sha256": "9bcb2989ba60c3d3c12faa166da0338160d0a0c3b927180d1e8c034b2a576f38", "ja": "宣材に使える構図は、限られているからな。\n最初からぐっと絞れるんだ。", "zh": "因为能当作宣传照的构图种类有限，\n可以先筛选掉一大半。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1035_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4329b2c2626b6d83a5d464fc7e1dd1da76fccfe93cbcaab8622e3170f92feb9b", "ja": "へえ～～～！\nさっすが{$P$}！", "zh": "原来是这样～～～！\n不愧是{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1036_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1670a33f0f18347a8bdf79486498454f0d4f2bf7773a196655291f49c0bc4650", "ja": "やっぱプロってすごいな～！\nよしっ、アタシも頑張んなきゃ……！", "zh": "专业人士真的很厉害耶～！\n好！我也要加油才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1037_p", "source_sha256": "0ac8a918c579c13e592e47cbab1f7c7d7dffd91ba2b6a2f96ee2edbecd476121", "ja": "（しかし改めて見ると、歩の動きが速いせいか\n同じ構図の写真があまりない……すごいな）", "zh": "（不过仔细一看，可能是因为步的动作太快了，\n其实每张照片的构图都不太一样……真厉害。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_002_1038_p", "source_sha256": "1d649f861729b72ce85b9328f6d87b726309b56e36a9f32cd06652155c10252b", "ja": "（歩の立ち位置は、すぐに入れ替わりそうだな。\n感心する側から、される側へ……）", "zh": "（我和步的立场马上就对调了。\n刚才是她佩服我，现在换我佩服她了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
